actions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":3,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3980179022","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2318#issuecomment-3980179022","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2318","id":3980179022,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7tPLZO","user":{"login":"DeerL1o","id":34850028,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODUwMDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34850028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerL1o","html_url":"https://github.com/DeerL1o","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerL1o/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerL1o/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerL1o/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerL1o/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerL1o/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerL1o/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerL1o/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerL1o/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerL1o/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-01T15:00:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-01T15:00:27Z","body":"> 你要说Trae跟不上节奏，我会给你点赞\n> \n> 你要说Trae的市场部想一出是一出，我也给你点赞\n> \n> 但是你说“吃相难看”，这就站不住脚了，国内外目前还没有比Trae更良心的 免费那么久、Trae CN至今还是免费的 之前按次收费，独此一家\n> \n> 也就是市场举措总是不给出适应期，业务拓展总跟不上节拍，实际操作这样多好：\n> \n> 1.对于已经付费的用户，应该按付费时的协议延续旧的付费模式，直至结束，实现平稳过渡 2.在撤掉Claude之前，先给出市场反应时间，Claude将会在某一天不再续费，但是当天未用完次数的用户，月末剩余次数翻倍 3.流量计费方式对标Claude Code、Gemini CLI\n\n首先，按次收费独此一家的说法不准确，copilot和winsurf一直都是按次收费，谈不上是唯一的良心代表\n\n其次，前期免费策略是互联网产品抢占市场的常规引流手段，作为市场后来者，免费是其打破壁垒、培养用户习惯的入场券，更多是商业生存策略，如果一开始就按token计费且模型优势尚未稳固，用户很难有理由从竞品迁移过来\n\n大家评价吃相难看，我觉得骂的不是收费本身，就像你说的是市场策略问题，先烧钱垄断用户选择，再突然改变规则，缺乏应有的过渡缓冲\n\n回归产品本身，trae依然是目前我认为交互最友好的AI IDE之一，不过好归好，但这波市场操作的步子迈的确实有点太急了","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3980179022/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3980179826","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2318#issuecomment-3980179826","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2318","id":3980179826,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7tPLly","user":{"login":"linzhan12","id":109981559,"node_id":"U_kgDOBo4vdw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109981559?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linzhan12","html_url":"https://github.com/linzhan12","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linzhan12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linzhan12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linzhan12/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linzhan12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linzhan12/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linzhan12/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linzhan12/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linzhan12/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linzhan12/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-01T15:00:39Z","updated_at":"2026-03-01T15:00:39Z","body":"重点是他自己的功能没有跟上啊，都是用过的人。之前是因为便宜，大小bug也认了，思考半天不吐字，上下文索引没压缩有时候也是莫名奇妙，国内免费，国际版我是付了钱的！！！你现在这个计费方式我为什么不用qoder？还比cusor你连qoder都比不过！！！","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3980179826/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"pe